OL,3,GNEWSANew fortnightly food bank service
OL,4,Aannounced
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new fortnightly food bank service is
OL,7,Fto open in an East Yorkshire town,
OL,8,Fgiving residents access to emergency
OL,9,Ffood supplies, advice and support
OL,10,Fwithout the need to travel further
OL,11,Fafield.
OL,13,FThe local Church of England group
OL,14,Fcovering Elloughton, Brough and
OL,15,FBrantingham has joined with the East
OL,16,FRiding Food Poverty Alliance to offer
OL,17,Fthe service.
OL,19,FThe food bank will be hosted at All
OL,20,FSaints Brough on the second and fourth
OL,21,FMondays of the month, starting on 11
OL,22,FJanuary.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
